.KKKK..KKKK.
KWWWWKKWWWWK
KWLLWKKWLLWK
KWWWWKKWWWWK
KWLLWKKWLWWK
KWWWWKKWWWWK
KBBBBBBBBBBK
.KKKKKKKKKK.

@frame book-turn
.KKKK.KKKKK.
KWWWWKWKWWWK
KWLLWKWWKLWK
KWWWWKKWKWWK
KWLLWKKWLWWK
KWWWWKKWWWWK
KBBBBBBBBBBK
.KKKKKKKKKK.
